<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ko" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>시니어 승인 · DebugMate</title><link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/app.css(v='20261029-3')}"><script defer th:src="@{/js/app.js(v='20261029-3')}"></script></head><body><header th:replace="~{fragments/layout :: header('admin')}"></header><main id="main-content" class="container page-shell"><div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">ADMIN REVIEW</p><h1>시니어 가입 승인</h1><p>이메일로 받은 경력과 포트폴리오를 확인한 뒤 승인 또는 반려하세요.</p></div><div class="flash" th:if="${message}" th:text="${message}"></div><div class="empty-state" th:if="${#lists.isEmpty(applicants)}"><strong>승인 대기 중인 신청자가 없습니다.</strong></div><div class="applicant-list" th:unless="${#lists.isEmpty(applicants)}"><article class="applicant" th:each="user : ${applicants}"><div class="applicant-heading"><div><h2 th:text="${user.displayName}">이름</h2><a th:href="${'mailto:' + user.email}" th:text="${user.email}">email</a></div><span class="status status-review_required">승인 대기</span></div><dl><dt>경력 및 전문 분야</dt><dd th:text="${user.careerSummary}">경력</dd><dt>포트폴리오</dt><dd><a th:if="${!#strings.isEmpty(user.portfolioUrl)}" th:href="${user.portfolioUrl}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" th:text="${user.portfolioUrl}">링크</a><span th:if="${#strings.isEmpty(user.portfolioUrl)}">미등록</span></dd></dl><div class="approval-actions"><form th:action="@{/admin/seniors/{id}/reject(id=${user.id})}" method="post"><button class="button danger" type="submit">반려</button></form><form th:action="@{/admin/seniors/{id}/approve(id=${user.id})}" method="post"><button class="button primary" type="submit">승인</button></form></div></article></div></main><footer th:replace="~{fragments/layout :: footer}"></footer></body></html>
